  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Business Sector Programme Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Business Sector Program Support in Vietnam supports the Vietnamese Government&apos;s efforts to improve conditions for the private sector. The program&apos;s five components include support to improve: 1) business environment, 2) working conditions in the private sector, 3) competitiveness, 4) settlement of commercial disputes and 5) industry-based research. 

The components are based on the objectives of the private sector in the Vietnamese government&apos;s poverty reduction strategy and gives priority to small and medium enterprises. The efforts are put on four provinces where there is a clear potential for business development and a local political determination to implement the necessary reforms into practice. 

The program structure ensures that the local experience and results are collected and analyzed so they can be included in deliberations on the reform process for further development at the national level.</narrative>
  </description>
